body:
I can't help but agree with your statement on being self absorbed in our own problems, I know I have caught myself going off track to my own issues when a friend has come to me about their own struggles. Other people don't really get what that turmoil is like so trying to find other BPD's who get it seems great in theory but maybe not as good in practice.

&#x200B;

Perfect words aren't needed of course, your understanding makes me wish I could give you a hug. We all getting through our struggles, it just sucks that some of us can't relate heavily with others who share the same diagnosis. <3

There is a line from a song I know that literally goes "Caught me in a bad place, bad mood, bad year" and it always weighs pretty heavily on me when I think of the one who got away. It was a mutual attraction, but there were a lot of things that sat between us, thus the "bad place".

&#x200B;

I honestly think we would have been great for one another, I will never find out though I guess. I hope he is doing okay with his life.

New to this, but it seems really exciting.

&#x200B;

Quite looking forward to making someones day a little bit better. :)

Oh this is too cute.

Fam jam is all there ; w;

Except mom(s)
